  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. The number of non-empty subsets of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> that have the sum of all elements a multiple of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>, is _____ ."
  },
