    "text": "<p>Given set is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Elements of the type <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>.</p><p>Elements of the type <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Elements of the type <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Subset&nbsp;containing one element <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Subsets containing two elements&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Subsets containing three elements&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>Subsets containing four elements&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>Subsets containing five elements&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Subsets containing six elements <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Subsets containing seven elements&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Required number</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></